{"title":"exploding otherworlds, aquarius III","link":"https://keningzhu.com/journal/aquarius-iii","date":1771339500000,"content":" \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/601f12ba-62ff-4dda-972a-2910229f25cb/aq3.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"2400\" height=\"1350\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/601f12ba-62ff-4dda-972a-2910229f25cb/aq3.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/601f12ba-62ff-4dda-972a-2910229f25cb/aq3.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/601f12ba-62ff-4dda-972a-2910229f25cb/aq3.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/601f12ba-62ff-4dda-972a-2910229f25cb/aq3.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/601f12ba-62ff-4dda-972a-2910229f25cb/aq3.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/601f12ba-62ff-4dda-972a-2910229f25cb/aq3.jpeg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/601f12ba-62ff-4dda-972a-2910229f25cb/aq3.jpeg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n  <p><em>this series is created for my collaboration with </em><a href=\"https://www.ceremony-studio.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\"><em>LJ of Ceremony</em></a><em> for their communal writing practice, </em><a href=\"https://www.ceremony-studio.co.uk/atmospheres\" target=\"_blank\"><em>Atmospheres</em></a><em>, based off the 36 decans of the astrological year. </em></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  <hr />\n  \n    \n\n    \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n  <p><strong>Aquarius III, Otherworlds</strong> — February 11-19<br /><strong>Key themes from LJ</strong> — hidden worlds, the maternal, erotic fantasies<br /><strong>Before this: </strong><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/aquarius-ii\" target=\"_blank\">Aquarius II,  poisoned apple as seer</a><br /><br />*</p><p>this decan contains my mother’s birthday, and with it, complexly layered dimensions of feelings about my mother, our relationship, and the various ways in which (I felt as though) I betrayed and abandoned her by disappearing into the underworld — that is, my inner psychic creative landscapes — a place where she cannot understand, a place she was convinced would lead to my hunger. this kind of individuation and severing <em>is</em> absolutely necessary, of course. but I don’t think that it makes it any less painful. </p><p>in working on this decan with LJ, we dove into the myth of Demeter and Persephone — from which the seasons are born — in which Persephone is abducted by Hades, and, because she swallows pomegranate seeds, is compelled to stay there months out of the year. after Aquarius II, with the portal of the <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/aquarius-ii\">poisioned apple</a>, this is a decan about crossing into other worlds, and inhabiting them fully. </p><p>I’ve fallen in love with pomegranates, previously, while on naxos island — <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/pomegranates-from-naxos-island\" target=\"_blank\">I drew them and wrote about them</a>, as a fruit that leaves your hands bloody; a fruit that does not die quietly. <br /><br />in this illustration, I wanted to capture the sensed feeling of a severed pomengranate — like the necessary cutting of the bond between mother and daughter — a violence that only explodes and engenders more worlds, even as it creates tiny jewels of pain that reverberates across time and distance. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  <hr />\n  \n    \n\n    \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n  <h1>process</h1>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/73aae201-009d-49e8-b472-81f05dfa72ba/Aq+3.gif?format=1000w\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/73aae201-009d-49e8-b472-81f05dfa72ba/Aq+3.gif?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/73aae201-009d-49e8-b472-81f05dfa72ba/Aq+3.gif?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/73aae201-009d-49e8-b472-81f05dfa72ba/Aq+3.gif?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/73aae201-009d-49e8-b472-81f05dfa72ba/Aq+3.gif?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/73aae201-009d-49e8-b472-81f05dfa72ba/Aq+3.gif?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/73aae201-009d-49e8-b472-81f05dfa72ba/Aq+3.gif?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/73aae201-009d-49e8-b472-81f05dfa72ba/Aq+3.gif?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n   